{"sections": [
  {"key": "arc", "title": "The arc", "sentences": [
    {"type": "fact", "text": "Revenue compounded at 14.7% a year from $96.6 billion in FY2017 to $331.8 billion in FY2026 [F1][F10][F221]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Operating income grew faster, at 20.5% a year, lifting operating margin from 30.1% to 46.8% [F223][F41][F50]."},
    {"type": "cause", "text": "FY2026 was the sharpest step, with revenue up 17.8% on growth in Microsoft Cloud, Azure and Microsoft 365 Commercial cloud [D472][P17]."},
    {"type": "cause", "text": "FY2018 broke the net-income line, falling 35.0% on the TCJA charge, while FY2019 rebounded 136.8% on a $2.6 billion intangible-property tax benefit [D48][D101][P61]."}
  ]},
  {"key": "drivers", "title": "What drove growth", "sentences": [
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Microsoft Cloud supplied 16.2pp of FY2026's 17.8% revenue growth and reached 64.6% of revenue [D568][D472][D566]."},
    {"type": "cause", "text": "Server products and cloud services added 11.0pp, as Azure and other cloud services grew 41% on demand across workloads [D642][P12]."},
    {"type": "cause", "text": "Microsoft 365 Commercial products and cloud services contributed 5.1pp, with cloud revenue up 17% on Copilot and E5 [D649][P14]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Profit outran revenue: incremental operating margin was 53.3% in FY2026 and operating expenses grew 7.4% against 17.8% revenue growth [D498][D491][D472]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Diluted EPS grew 31.6% against 31.3% net income growth, with the diluted share count down 0.2% [D476][D474][D493]."}
  ]},
  {"key": "margins", "title": "Margins and costs", "sentences": [
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Operating margin of 46.8% is a window high, 5.1pp above the 41.7% median and 16.7pp above the FY2017 low [F50][D974][D975][D973]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Gross margin slipped 0.9pp to 67.9%, below its 68.2% median, as cost of revenue grew 21.1% against 17.8% revenue growth [D486][F30][D981][D489][D472]."},
    {"type": "cause", "text": "The FY2026 operating-margin gain came from R&D (+0.8pp) and other lines (+1.2pp), partly offset by cost of revenue (-0.9pp) [D501][D502][D500]."},
    {"type": "cause", "text": "Intelligent Cloud gross margin fell on continued AI infrastructure investment and mix shift to Azure, partly offset by Azure efficiency gains [P11]."},
    {"type": "cause", "text": "Net margin rose 4.2pp to 40.3%, helped by $6.5 billion of net OpenAI gains in other income [D488][F70][P7]."}
  ]},
  {"key": "cash", "title": "Cash conversion", "sentences": [
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Operating cash flow of $182.9 billion was 1.37x net income, but free cash flow of $67.0 billion was only 0.50x, the window low [F100][D459][F120][D460][D988]."},
    {"type": "cause", "text": "Capex rose 79.6% to $115.9 billion, 34.9% of revenue, as additions to property and equipment increased $51.4 billion [D479][F110][D455][P1]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Free cash flow margin fell to 20.2% from a 30.3% median, and capex ran at 3.38x D&A [D456][D984][D461]."},
    {"type": "cause", "text": "Operating cash flow growth of 34.4% came from higher customer receipts and lower income-tax payments, partly offset by supplier payments [D477][P1]."}
  ]},
  {"key": "balance_sheet", "title": "Balance sheet and capital allocation", "sentences": [
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Net cash was $72.9 billion, 22.0% of revenue, in the 83rd percentile of six software peers against a -7.2% median [D465][D466][D1006][D1007]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Total debt fell to $40.3 billion while cash and investments held at $113.2 billion, and the current ratio of 1.23x is a window low [D464][D463][F200][D991]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Buybacks of $22.3 billion plus dividends of $26.4 billion absorbed 72.7% of free cash flow [X147][X157][D468]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "The diluted share count fell only 0.2%, so per-share growth came from earnings rather than shrinkage [D493]."}
  ]},
  {"key": "red_flags", "title": "Red flags", "sentences": [
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Free cash flow stayed below 80% of net income for two years, at 0.70x in FY2025 and 0.50x in FY2026, the lowest in the window [R1][D406][D460][D988]."},
